    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mic ma Wema Maleŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ri Musa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Waci ri Joisiraili jowomiyan mic. Jol mic moro je ma nyatoro mito miyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mic no wobedi, zahabu, feza, ywel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nangin mafoth, manyabululu, manyarangi ariŋo, kodi pien rombo m'obokere, nanga m'otimi gi yer diel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "piendere wot rombo m'owir m'obokere, piendere diegi, mbawo kasia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mo talin, gigipiny manitie gi kur mamit ma ruwo gi mo ma wir kodi ri buban manitie gi kur mamit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Telin ma welo m'obokere obokere, kodi telin ma tweyo ri law pa jadwoŋ pa jocway ri Were i wi migam kodi ri mugowa ma ketho giŋeyo mito pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji joripo geto ran wema maleŋ, ŋey anyal bedo i dier jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tim win kodi gigipiny ma iye i nger can m'akidho nyuthin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kakan ma Cikirok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jowotimi ran Kakan ma Cikirok wok kwoŋ mbawo kasia, boro mere wobedi inci piero aŋwen g'abic, laco inci piero ario g'abirio, kodi ŋawirok inci piero ario g'abirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woum iye gi dieŋeye kodi zahabu macil thoko, aka wokethi miango ma loko maŋon thoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wotim rigo petin aŋwen ma zahabu t'iriwo gi tiende aŋwen, petin ario i kisi thenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wotim gute ma kasia aka woum gi zahabu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "t'irwako jo i petin ma kisi thengi Kakan ma Cikirok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gute no joripo doŋ i petin aka kiripi fudho woko jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo oketh'iye telin mapando ario m'ondik'iye Or.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jowotimi giumo gi zahabu macil, boro mere inci piero aŋwen g'abic, aka laco inci piero ario g'abirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wotim cwec ma jobwombi gin ario gi zahabu m'ocadhi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "acel ri kisi gike ma giumo. Wotim ŋey joworom giumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cwec ma jonigi bwombi gin jowoŋiyere karo giumo, aka bwombi gin woumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wokethi telin mapando ario i Kakan ma Cikirok, t'iketho giumo i wiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abino romo kodin kenyo, aka i wi giumo i dier cwec ma jobwombi gin, abino miyin cik je ri Joisiraili.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Meza ma mugat m'imiyo Were",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wotim meza wok kwoŋ mbawo kasia, boro mere inci piero adek g'aucel, laco inci apar g'aboro, aka ŋawirok inci piero ario g'abirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woum gi zahabu macil aka wothok gine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wotim miango mere ma inci adek i laco, aka wothok gi zahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wotim petin aŋwen gi zahabu t'iketho i sonda aŋwen, kama tiende jonitie iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petin ma thielo gute ma tiŋo meza wokethi cegin gi miango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wotim gute ma mbawo kasia, t'iumo gi zahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wotim sendere, kikopere, agwatin, kodi atewe m'ilaoro i mic ma vini. Joje wotim gi zahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.24.5+LEV.24.6+LEV.24.7+LEV.24.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 24:5-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meza no wokethi ruwaŋ Kakan ma Cikirok, aka i meza no noknok wobedi mugat maleŋ m'imiyan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
